WEBVTT

1
00:00:12.150 --> 00:00:18.310
Today is the third day of the National Free Days, and today is the closing rally.

2
00:00:18.310 --> 00:00:20.030
And today we are walking through Wegberg.

3
00:00:25.350 --> 00:00:30.630
It is simply about perceiving oneself as nationally free for a few days a year.

4
00:00:30.670 --> 00:00:37.230
And now we want to reach out to the people and explain this artwork here.

5
00:00:37.230 --> 00:00:38.030
Let us explain.

6
00:01:11.290 --> 00:01:18.169
We have the impression that countries are isolating themselves in national bubbles

7
00:01:18.209 --> 00:01:25.129
and everyone only sees themselves. With this art project, I want to set a clear counterpoint

8
00:01:25.129 --> 00:01:30.609
for greater community and solidarity worldwide and across Europe.

9
00:01:30.610 --> 00:01:31.489
Across all borders.

10
00:01:40.050 --> 00:01:45.650
I have no special favors to hand out, but you are welcome to watch our demonstration.

11
00:01:45.650 --> 00:01:47.769
What is this all about?

12
00:02:07.310 --> 00:02:13.309
Here is a brief explanation of the 'High Horses' – the high European horses.

13
00:02:13.310 --> 00:02:20.189
The idea originated in 2014 after the financial crisis, when European nations drifted apart.

14
00:02:20.190 --> 00:02:27.190
I felt that countries were turning away from Europe, which was alarming.

15
00:02:27.190 --> 00:02:33.750
So we created the European symbol, the flag, and the 28 nation states.

16
00:02:33.750 --> 00:02:39.950
The idea was for nation states to get off their high horses and come down towards European unity,

17
00:02:39.950 --> 00:02:46.350
towards genuine community and shared responsibility.

18
00:02:46.350 --> 00:02:53.310
That unfortunately hasn't happened yet. Here we are in 2026.

19
00:02:53.310 --> 00:03:00.149
Where are the horses today? They are not lower, but half a meter higher!

20
00:03:00.149 --> 00:03:05.210
Even higher up than before.

21
00:03:06.649 --> 00:03:13.329
That makes this artwork more relevant than ever. Look at figures like Trump:

22
00:03:13.329 --> 00:03:20.089
they sit high up, detached from reality, while nations turn in the wrong direction.

23
00:03:20.089 --> 00:03:24.449
They are so far away from collective solutions.

24
00:03:24.889 --> 00:03:30.969
The kinetic mechanism turns: we want to push it forward towards unity,

25
00:03:30.969 --> 00:03:37.609
but in reality, nationalist forces try to turn the horses backwards.

26
00:03:37.649 --> 00:03:44.649
They try to reverse European progress.

27
00:03:45.130 --> 00:03:51.369
That is what this art project directly opposes. And here is our European Greeting:

28
00:03:51.369 --> 00:03:57.129
For everyone who wants more community in the world and Europe:

29
00:03:57.130 --> 00:04:04.009
"Down with national vanity – and respect, respect, respect for you!"

30
00:04:04.890 --> 00:04:10.599
Respect for one another! We want to push Europe forward together.

31
00:04:11.320 --> 00:04:16.959
We want all nations pulling in one harmonious direction:

32
00:04:16.960 --> 00:04:22.319
respecting European laws, upholding international law, strengthening the UN,

33
00:04:22.320 --> 00:04:28.679
and empowering common democratic institutions like the European Parliament.

34
00:04:28.679 --> 00:04:35.520
Ultimately leading towards a true European government.

35
00:04:35.520 --> 00:04:42.359
We want to accelerate Europe, with all horses pulling forward united.

36
00:04:42.600 --> 00:04:47.959
The lower the horses sit, the better they can pull together without bending.

37
00:04:48.119 --> 00:04:55.040
Closer to the common core means greater strength and synergy.

38
00:04:55.040 --> 00:05:00.279
Down from pride, united in purpose.

39
00:05:00.279 --> 00:05:07.179
That is how we can advance society.

40
00:05:07.179 --> 00:05:14.140
That concludes the National Free Days for 2026.

41
00:05:14.820 --> 00:05:21.619
And look forward to next year: 2027 will span 4 days!

42
00:05:21.619 --> 00:05:28.540
In Czech: "4. Dny Bez Národnosti" (1–4 June 2027) in Prague.

43
00:05:28.540 --> 00:05:35.099
We are organizing an international event in Prague for European and global community.

44
00:05:35.100 --> 00:05:40.859
Thank you for your attention. Visit watteuropa.org for more videos and info.

45
00:05:40.899 --> 00:05:47.499
Thank you and see you next year in Prague!
